«
@@ ============================================================
@@ MinΔtTraj — fastest transfer under a ΔV budget
@@ Bisection: smallest flight time whose TrCost stays within budget.
@@ Author & design         : Jean Wilson
@@ Co-authors & programming : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
@@
@@ Input  : t₁ 'Af' 'Bf' budget tof_lo tof_hi   ( t₁ 'Af' 'Bf' budget tof_lo tof_hi -- { tof ΔV } )
@@ Output : { tof ΔV }
@@ VALIDATION (device-confirmed):
@@   1 'AstronTXPrecision' STO
@@   2459054 'Ⓛ♁Pf' 'Ⓛ♂Pf' 7 150 205 MinΔtTraj -> { 173.63 6.990 }   (7 km/s budget)
@@ ============================================================
 → t1 Af Bf budget toflo tofhi
  « 0 0 0 0 0 → lo hi mid dvm niter
    «
      '3·AstronTXPrecision+3' EVAL 'niter' STO
      toflo →Num 'lo' STO  tofhi →Num 'hi' STO
      1 niter START
        'lo+(hi-lo)/2' EVAL 'mid' STO
        t1  t1 mid +  Af Bf ⓁTrCost 1 GET 'dvm' STO
        IF dvm budget > THEN mid 'lo' STO ELSE mid 'hi' STO END
      NEXT
      'lo+(hi-lo)/2' EVAL 'mid' STO
      mid
      t1  t1 mid +  Af Bf ⓁTrCost 1 GET
      2 →LIST
    »
  »
»
